"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1927,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["airflow","apache","apache-airflow","automation","dag","data-engineering","data-integration","data-orchestrator","data-pipelines","data-science","elt","etl","machine-learning","mlops","orchestration","python","scheduler","workflow","workflow-engine","workflow-orchestration"],"visibility":"public","forks":18214,"open_issues":1927,"watchers":47308,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/pulls/70783","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70783","diff_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70783.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/pull/70783.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-22T14:11:02Z"},"body":" <!-- SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\r\n      https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0 -->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nThank you for contributing!\r\n\r\nPlease provide above a brief description of the changes made in this pull request.\r\nWrite a good git commit message following this guide: https://chris.beams.io/posts/git-commit/\r\n\r\nPlease make sure that your code changes are covered with tests.\r\nAnd in case of new features or big changes remember to adjust the documentation.\r\n\r\nFor user-facing UI changes, please attach before/after screenshots (or a short\r\nscreen recording) so reviewers can assess the visual impact.\r\n\r\nFeel free to ping (in general) for the review if you do not see reaction for a few days\r\n(72 Hours is the minimum reaction time you can expect from volunteers) - we sometimes miss notifications.\r\n\r\nIn case of an existing issue, reference it using one of the following:\r\n\r\n* closes: #ISSUE\r\n* related: #ISSUE\r\n-->\r\n\r\ncloses: #70720\r\n\r\nMake JWTRefreshMiddleware extensible via BaseAuthManager.get_jwt_refresh_middleware()\r\n---\r\nRefactor the initialisation flow for the `JWTRefreshMiddleware` to give greater control to auth managers over how this middleware gets initialised.\r\n\r\nBy moving the `JWTRefreshMiddleware` initialisation to `BaseAuthManager.get_jwt_refresh_middleware()`, this allows auth managers to override the JWTRefreshMiddleware behaviour by inheriting from it and using the inherited class in get_fastapi_middlewares instead.\r\n\r\n* Changed the `_refresh_user()` and `_build_cookie_headers()` methods to public `refresh_user()` and `build_cookie_headers()` methods to allow accessing any cookies or state information from the request and setting cookies in the response. \r\n* `get_extra_cookies()` allows subclasses to add / clear additional cookies in the response when a new user token is issued.\r\n* `generate_new_user_token()` allows subclasses to control how JWTs are issued for new users.\r\n\r\nAlso adds the `airflow.api_fastapi.app.request_cookie_is_secure()` helper to standardise setting HTTP secure cookies\r\n\r\n##### Was generative AI tooling used to co-author this PR?\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nIf generative AI tooling has been used in the process of authoring this PR, please\r\nchange below checkbox to `[X]` followed by the name of the tool, uncomment the \"Generated-by\".\r\n-->\r\n\r\n- [ ] Yes (please specify the tool below)\r\n- [X] No\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nGenerated-by: [Tool Name] following [the guidelines](https://github.com/apache/airflow/blob/main/contributing-docs/05_pull_requests.rst#gen-ai-assisted-contributions)\r\n-->\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/70783/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":33958186172,"node_id":"CE_lADOAgUK288AAAABKxFHEc8AAAAH6BDMvA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/33958186172","actor":{"login":"pierrejeambrun","id":14861206,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODYxMjA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14861206?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun","html_url":"https://github.com/pierrejeambrun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pierrejeambrun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-10-22T14:11:04Z","state_reason":null,"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null}]]
